  Switchroot / brcmfmac, drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/msgbuf.c
  https://github.com/CTCaer/switch-l4t-kernel-4.9/blob/linux-5.1.2/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/msgbuf.c

  Switchroot / brcmfmac, drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/pcie.c
  https://github.com/CTCaer/switch-l4t-kernel-4.9/blob/linux-5.1.2/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/pcie.c

  Switchroot / brcmfmac, chip.c and firmware.c in the same source directory.
  The shared EROM and NVRAM headers retain their own 2010/2013 ISC notices.

